    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Navigation sphere, Warleader sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use pathing as a standard action, you can begin or maintain a tactic as a free action; doing so changes the area of the tactic to the area of your pathing.</p>\n<p>While within the area of your pathing, you can maintain this tactic as a free action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
